/li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 99.2989%;\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 55.657%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"429\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.6419%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"369\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 99.2989%;\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"798\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 55.657%;\" colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Interview Letter</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.6419%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"Interview Letter\" href=\"https://www.upessc.net/pgt2022callletter/Login.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Interview Schedule&nbsp;</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://upessc.up.gov.in/Notice/aaa2-f856-4ed0-f5b6-cb3d.pdf\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 55.657%;\" colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Result</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.6419%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b> | </b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 55.657%;\" colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Result Notice</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.6419%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"UP PGT Result\" href=\"https://upessc.up.gov.in/Notice/4845-cc22-4956-379b-8ba3.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 55.657%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"429\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Answer 